Iran’s Vienna mission slams Grossi’s ‘selective outrage’ over attacks on nuclear facilities

Iran’s permanent mission to international organizations in Vienna has sharply criticized IAEA Director General Rafael Grossi for applying a clear double standard in his response to attacks on nuclear facilities.

